@hint getConsultantLeadAggregate Aggregate lead-counter (no PII; public)
@hint captureConsultantLead Capture a consultant program enquiry (public)
@hint listTenantLinksForTenant List the caller's tenant links (cloud)
@hint listConsultantsForTenant List consultants attested into the caller's tenant (cloud)
@hint getConsultantForTenant Fetch a consultant scoped to the caller's tenant (cloud)
@hint getWhiteLabelConfigForTenant Fetch the active white-label brand config for the caller's tenant (cloud)
@hint listCertifications List certifications (admin)
@hint createCertification Create a certification (admin)
@hint updateCertification Revoke or update certification validity (admin)
@hint listLeads List consultant leads (admin)
@hint createLead Create a consultant lead (admin / import)
@hint convertLead Mark a lead converted (admin)
@hint qualifyLead Mark a lead qualified (admin)
@hint listTenantLinks List consultant↔tenant links (admin)
@hint createTenantLink Invite a consultant to a tenant (admin)
@hint updateTenantLink Accept invite or change scope (admin)
@hint revokeTenantLink Revoke a consultant↔tenant link (admin)
@hint listConsultants List consultants (admin)
@hint createConsultant Create a consultant (admin)
@hint getConsultant Fetch a consultant (admin)
@hint updateConsultant Update a consultant (admin)
@hint softDeleteConsultant Soft-delete a consultant (admin)
@hint certifyConsultant Certify a consultant (admin)
@hint suspendConsultant Suspend a consultant (admin)
@hint listWhiteLabelConfigs List white-label brand configs (admin)
@hint createWhiteLabelConfig Create a white-label brand config (admin)

@end
